(54, 'page', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 'Terms & Condition', 'terms-condition', NULL, 'Bhaiya Group of Industries is one of Bangladesh\'s most prominent and diversified conglomerates, with a legacy spanning over 50 years. Founded by Alhaj Moksud Ali, the group has grown into a multifaceted organization with interests in food manufacturing, real estate, insurance, hospitality, and more.', '<main class=\"min-h-screen\">\r\n<section class=\"py-20 mt-10\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"prose max-w-none text-gray-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\r\n<p data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"249\"><strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"237\">Last Updated:</strong> August 2026</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"474\">Welcome to our Housing Listing Platform. By accessing or using this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the platform.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"bzr0nb\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"501\">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"705\">By creating an account, browsing listings, submitting inquiries, or using any services provided by the platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms and Conditions.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pckjsk\" data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"724\">2. Eligibility</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"863\">You must be at least 18 years old or have the legal authority to enter into binding agreements in your jurisdiction to use this platform.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cwtsyj\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"884\">3. User Accounts</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppliqj\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"972\">You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gs3nhd\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1052\">All information provided during registration must be accurate and up to date.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s48wvv\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1123\">You are responsible for all activities conducted under your account.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17kw9h9\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1205\">We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9a0rvt\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1230\">4. Property Listings</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1268\">Users posting properties agree that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19j9p0c\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1326\">All listing information must be truthful and accurate.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vpz8nz\" data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1388\">Images and descriptions must represent the actual property.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10br3ni\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1446\">You have the legal authority to advertise the property.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fprs4g\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1510\">Duplicate, misleading, or fraudulent listings are prohibited.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zuct3n\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1600\">We may edit, reject, or remove listings that violate our policies without prior notice.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1m0ofmt\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1629\">5. User Responsibilities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1648\">You agree not to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1upqy21\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1689\">Post false or misleading information.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhm4yh\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1761\">Upload illegal, offensive, or copyrighted content without permission.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lgg74\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1833\">Attempt unauthorized access to the platform or other users\' accounts.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kbtvsh\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1904\">Use automated tools to scrape or collect data without authorization.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pkdabj\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1987\">Engage in fraudulent transactions or impersonate another person or organization.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nt5dl6\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2024\">6. Payments and Premium Services</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2063\">If the platform offers paid services:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2252\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t13w00\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2117\">All applicable fees are displayed before purchase.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"th7rld\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2182\">Payments are generally non-refundable unless otherwise stated.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d85ijo\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2252\">Premium features may be modified or discontinued at our discretion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"toiuwk\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2287\">7. Communication Between Users</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2386\">The platform may facilitate communication between buyers, sellers, landlords, tenants, or agents.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2415\">We are not responsible for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3a36x\" data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2460\">The accuracy of statements made by users.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12jqgpa\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2501\">Agreements entered into between users.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8s3acn\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2559\">Disputes, losses, or damages arising from transactions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2656\">Users should independently verify all information before making financial or legal commitments.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ar4ers\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2685\">8. Intellectual Property</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2874\">All website content, including logos, designs, software, text, graphics, and trademarks, is owned by or licensed to the platform and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2968\">Users may not reproduce, distribute, or modify any content without prior written permission.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vodyld\" data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2993\">9. Third-Party Links</h2>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3171\">Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. We do not control or endorse these external resources and are not responsible for their content or practices.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"jxoaqa\" data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3204\">10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3270\">The platform is provided on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3292\">We do not guarantee:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3492\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g141s5\" data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3337\">The accuracy or completeness of listings.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xaaihd\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3379\">Continuous availability of the website.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xpfx21\" data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3439\">That listings are free from errors or misrepresentations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nt87k2\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3492\">Successful completion of any property transaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3571\">Users should conduct their own due diligence before entering into agreements.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yqsi19\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3603\">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3682\">To the fullest extent permitted by law, the platform shall not be liable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3889\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11gsdq8\" data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3722\">Direct or indirect financial losses.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f37xi0\" data-start=\"3723\" data-end=\"3743\">Property disputes.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"asmf39\" data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3791\">Fraudulent listings created by third parties.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hzlnv3\" data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3816\">Business interruption.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21a5cp\" data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3889\">Data loss or unauthorized access despite reasonable security measures.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1shlgtq\" data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3905\">12. Privacy</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4046\">Your use of the platform is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"iskvwi\" data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4089\">13. Account Suspension and Termination</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4173\">We reserve the right to suspend, restrict, or permanently terminate accounts that:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4292\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1btiy1f\" data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4212\">Violate these Terms and Conditions.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xk9beq\" data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4256\">Engage in fraudulent or abusive behavior.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vasi19\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4292\">Harm other users or the platform.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1y08p0c\" data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4327\">14. Modifications to the Terms</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4488\">We may update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes become effective constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rhpvci\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4510\">15. Governing Law</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4700\">These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which the platform operates, unless otherwise required by applicable law.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u48m9s\" data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4728\">16. Contact Information</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4865\">For questions or concerns regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us through the support channels provided on the website.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main>', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Bhaiya Group of Industries is one of Bangladesh\'s most prominent and diversified conglomerates, with a legacy spanning over 50 years. Founded by Alhaj Moksud Ali, the group has grown into a multifaceted organization with interests in food manufacturing, real estate, insurance, hospitality, and more.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,-\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"375\"></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Terms & Condition', 'Terms & Condition', 'Terms & Condition', 1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-25 02:59:32', '2026-06-25 04:09:44');
