(60, 'project', NULL, 1, 5, 3, 'Sadia Akter', 'sadia-akter', NULL, 'Portonics Ltd.', '<p>Sadia is a dedicated professional from Narayanganj, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Freelancer at Bangladesh Textile Mills. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 3 years of experience in the field.</p>', '[]', '[]', '<p>Sadia is a dedicated professional from Narayanganj, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Freelancer at Bangladesh Textile Mills. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 3 years of experience in the field.</p>', '[{\"key\": \"Garage\", \"value\": \"Bangladesh\"}]', '[]', NULL, 'Portonics Ltd.', 'uploads/project/img_6a3f8ffe28eba_1782550526.webp', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-06-15 10:30:00', NULL, 'ShurjoMukhi Ltd.', 'Sadia is a dedicated professional from Moulvibazar, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Marketing Executive at Energypac Power Generation. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 7 years of experience in the field.', NULL, 0, 0, 3, NULL, '2025-06-15 04:30:00', '2025-06-15 04:30:00', '2026-06-27 02:58:25', '2026-06-27 02:55:26', '2026-06-27 02:58:25'),
(61, 'project', 1, 1, 12, 3, 'Manikganj', 'manikganj', NULL, 'Pran-RFL Group', '<p>Mostofa is a dedicated professional from Narail, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Teacher at ACI Limited. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 3 years of experience in the field.</p>', '[]', '[]', '<p>Mostofa is a dedicated professional from Narail, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Teacher at ACI Limited. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 3 years of experience in the field.</p>', '[{\"key\": \"Garage\", \"value\": \"Bangladesh\"}]', '[\"Security\", \"Lift\", \"Fire exit\", \"WASA connection\", \"Self Water supply\", \"Hot water\", \"Cylinder Gas\", \"Electricity\", \"Generator\", \"Intercom\", \"CCTV\", \"Wi-Fi connectivity\", \"Satellite or cable TV\", \"Electronic security\", \"Garden\", \"Solar panels\", \"Servant Room\", \"Servant Toilet\", \"Fire Protection\"]', NULL, 'Kaz Software', 'uploads/project/img_6a3f909a18a3f_1782550682.webp', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-06-15 10:30:00', NULL, 'Bangladesh', 'Mostofa is a dedicated professional from Natore, Bangladesh. Currently working as a Business Analyst at Therap BD. Passionate about technology and innovation, with 8 years of experience in the field.', NULL, -1, 0, 3, NULL, NULL, '2025-06-15 04:30:00', '2026-06-27 02:58:22', '2026-06-27 02:58:02', '2026-06-27 02:58:22'),
(62, 'faq', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'How do I post my property requirement?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>You can post your property requirements completely free by navigating to our \"Post your Requirement\" page. Simply fill in the property type, size, preferred location, and your contact details. Our automated system will match your request with active developers and notify you.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:15:09', '2026-06-27 04:15:09'),
(63, 'faq', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Are there any fees or commissions for property buyers?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>No, our portal is 100% free for property buyers and seekers. You can browse projects, compare listings, use the mortgage/EMI calculator, and contact developers directly without paying any commission or service fees.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:15:09', '2026-06-27 04:15:09'),
(64, 'faq', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'How long does it take for a developer account to be approved?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Once a developer registers their company profile, our admin team reviews the business credentials and trade license. This verification process typically takes between 12 to 24 hours. Once approved, the developer can start listing their projects immediately.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:15:09', '2026-06-27 04:15:09'),
(65, 'faq', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Can I compare multiple properties side by side?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Yes! You can compare up to 3 properties at a time. Simply click the balance scale icon on any property card to add it to the comparison bar. Once selected, click the \"Compare Now\" button to view a detailed, side-by-side comparison of prices, sizes, and specs.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:15:09', '2026-06-27 04:15:09'),
(66, 'faq', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'What is a 360° Virtual Tour and how do I use it?', NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>A 360° Virtual Tour allows you to explore an apartment in immersive 3D from the comfort of your home. If a property has a virtual tour uploaded by the developer, a \"360° Tour\" tab will appear on the details page. Click the tab and use your mouse (or finger on mobile) to drag and look around the property.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:15:09', '2026-06-27 04:15:09'),
(67, 'partner', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 'Banak Asia', NULL, NULL, '0.5', '<ul>\r\n<li>Loan Tenure: Up to 25 years loan term</li>\r\n<li>Loan Amount: Up to 80% of the apartment price including Registration costs</li>\r\n<li>Customers can take a loan to purchase an apartment without incurring registration costs.</li>\r\n<li>Full/partial early payment option of the loan amount before expiry.</li>\r\n<li>Transparent process in determining the interest rate</li>\r\n<li>No hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/partner/img_6a3fa5cca3601_1782556108.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:28:29', '2026-06-27 04:32:10'),
(68, 'partner', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 'City Bank', NULL, NULL, '0.65', '<ul>\r\n<li>Loan Tenure: Up to 25 years loan term</li>\r\n<li>Loan Amount: Up to 80% of the apartment price including Registration costs</li>\r\n<li>Customers can take a loan to purchase an apartment without incurring registration costs.</li>\r\n<li>Full/partial early payment option of the loan amount before expiry.</li>\r\n<li>Transparent process in determining the interest rate</li>\r\n<li>No hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/partner/img_6a3fa9985c346_1782557080.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:44:40', '2026-06-27 04:45:01'),
(69, 'partner', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, 'The Premier Bank', NULL, NULL, '0.55', '<ul>\r\n<li>Loan Tenure: Up to 25 years loan term</li>\r\n<li>Loan Amount: Up to 80% of the apartment price including Registration costs</li>\r\n<li>Customers can take a loan to purchase an apartment without incurring registration costs.</li>\r\n<li>Full/partial early payment option of the loan amount before expiry.</li>\r\n<li>Transparent process in determining the interest rate</li>\r\n<li>No hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/partner/img_6a3fa9e2db77d_1782557154.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, -1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 04:45:54', '2026-06-27 04:45:54'),
(70, 'area_guide', NULL, 1, NULL, 1, 'Dhaka 300 Feet', 'dhaka-300-feetss', NULL, 'The New Gateway to Modern Urban Living & Seamless Connectivity in Dhaka', '<h2>A Vibrant Lifestyle Hub and Modern Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Beyond its supreme connectivity, Dhaka 300 Feet has transformed into a massive weekend leisure destination. Lined with hundreds of popular restaurants, open-air food courts, and resort-style recreation parks, it is the ultimate getaway for city dwellers seeking a breath of fresh air and scenic sunset views.</p>\r\n<p>The surrounding region is rapidly developing into a premium institutional zone. Highly reputed international schools, universities, state-of-the-art hospitals, and sports complexes (including the upcoming Sheikh Hasina International Cricket Stadium) are established within short driving distance, guaranteeing an elite lifestyle for families.</p>', '<h2>Purbachal 300 Feet: The Future of Dhaka\'s Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p>Dhaka&rsquo;s Purbachal 300 Feet Road, officially known as the&nbsp;<strong>Sheikh Hasina Sarani</strong>, is currently the most spectacular and modern expressway in Bangladesh. Connecting the busy Kuril Flyover directly to the Purbachal New Town, this 12.5-kilometer-long, 14-lane marvel has completely redefined urban planning and connectivity in the capital.</p>\r\n<p>With designated express lanes, service roads, and aesthetic underpasses, commuting from the heart of Dhaka to the eastern suburbs now takes only a few minutes. It also offers direct, congestion-free bypass access to Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport, Bashundhara R/A, and the Dhaka-Sylhet Highway, making it the most strategic transport corridor in the country.</p>', '<h2>The Ultimate Real Estate Hotspot for Investors</h2>\r\n<p>If you are planning to secure your future home or make a highly profitable investment, Dhaka 300 Feet is undoubtedly the number one choice. It is currently the most active real estate hub in Bangladesh, attracting top-tier developers who are launching iconic luxury high-rises, smart residential communities, and commercial business districts.</p>\r\n<p>From budget-friendly land sharing apartments to elite luxury duplexes, Purbachal offers diverse property options with guaranteed high ROI (Return on Investment) over the next 5 to 10 years. Investing in Purbachal 300 Feet means embracing a peaceful, green, and highly organized urban future.</p>', NULL, '[{\"key\": \"Average Price\", \"value\": \"30000\"}, {\"key\": \"Popular Schools\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"key\": \"College\", \"value\": \"5\"}, {\"key\": \"Top Hospitals\", \"value\": \"3\"}, {\"key\": \"Development Status\", \"value\": \"new\"}]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'uploads/area_guide/img_6a3fbf388cf6a_1782562616.webp', '[\"uploads/area_guide/img_6a3fbf3890374_1782562616.webp\", \"uploads/area_guide/img_6a3fbf3890677_1782562616.webp\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-27 06:16:56', '2026-08-10 05:33:35'),
